---
permalink: ./index.html
title: 群星之间
bodyClass: world-index
pageType: star-map
scriptFile: star-map-3d.js
cssFiles:
  - base.css
  - nav.css
  - star-map.css
  - worlds.css
  - responsive.css
---
{% extends "base.njk" %}

{% block content %}
<section id="star-map-stage" aria-labelledby="star-map-title">
  <h1 id="star-map-title" class="sr-only">群星之间 · 三世界空间档案</h1>

  <div class="star-map-field-grid" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="star-map-scanline" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="star-map-vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <header class="star-map-telemetry" aria-hidden="true">
    <strong><i></i> DEEP FIELD ACQUIRED</strong>
    <span id="star-map-route-state">ATS / ROUTE-01 / ARK–TERRA</span>
  </header>

  <a
    class="star-map-version-switch"
    data-star-map-version-switch
    href="./star-map-b4-prototype.html"
    aria-label="查看上一版 B4 星图"
  >
    <span>PREVIOUS PLATE</span>
    <strong>B4 星图</strong>
  </a>

  <div id="star-map-signals" aria-label="空间中的其他世界">
    <a class="star-map-signal" href="./arknights.html" data-world-signal="arknights" style="--x:34%;--y:50%;--signal:#d9a441;--signal-rgb:217,164,65">
      <span class="star-map-signal-reticle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <small>01 / ARK–TERRA</small>
      <strong>泰拉</strong>
      <em>明日方舟</em>
    </a>
    <a class="star-map-signal" href="./wh40k.html" data-world-signal="wh40k" style="--x:18%;--y:28%;--signal:#b9433e;--signal-rgb:185,67,62">
      <span class="star-map-signal-reticle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <small>02 / WH–M42</small>
      <strong>破碎银河</strong>
      <em>战锤 40,000</em>
    </a>
    <a class="star-map-signal" href="./ff14.html" data-world-signal="ff14" style="--x:22%;--y:72%;--signal:#8fc8f3;--signal-rgb:143,200,243">
      <span class="star-map-signal-reticle" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      <small>03 / FF–AETHER</small>
      <strong>十四世界</strong>
      <em>最终幻想 XIV</em>
    </a>
  </div>

  <article id="star-map-readout" aria-live="polite">
    <p class="star-map-readout-index" id="star-map-readout-index">WORLD 01 / 03 · ARK–TERRA</p>
    <p class="star-map-readout-ip" id="star-map-readout-ip">明日方舟 / ORIGINIUM OBSERVATION</p>
    <h2 id="star-map-readout-title">泰拉</h2>
    <p class="star-map-readout-summary" id="star-map-readout-summary">天灾与源石共同改写文明的生存方式。移动城邦、国家与组织在这颗行星上留下彼此交叠的记录。</p>
    <dl class="star-map-readout-facts" id="star-map-readout-facts">
      <div><dt>结构</dt><dd>独立行星 / 近轨道观测</dd></div>
      <div><dt>档案</dt><dd>主世界线 · 集成战略 · 泰拉图谱</dd></div>
    </dl>
    <a class="star-map-enter" id="star-map-enter" href="./arknights.html">
      <span>进入世界档案</span><b aria-hidden="true">↗</b>
    </a>
  </article>

  <aside class="star-map-provenance" id="star-map-provenance">
    <strong>TERRA SURFACE / COMMUNITY CARTOGRAPHY</strong>
    <p>六边形区划依据官方公开信息；地形与部分标注来自社区补绘。球面化仅用于视觉观察，不代表官方地理投影。</p>
  </aside>

  <p class="star-map-instruction" id="star-map-instruction">
    <span>拖动旋转当前天体</span><span>滚轮调整观测距离</span><span>点击远距信号切换世界</span>
  </p>

  <div id="star-map-loading" role="status">CALIBRATING SPATIAL ATLAS</div>

  <nav id="star-map-fallback" aria-label="世界档案">
    <p>三维星图暂时不可用，仍可直接进入世界档案。</p>
    <a href="./arknights.html">明日方舟</a>
    <a href="./wh40k.html">战锤 40,000</a>
    <a href="./ff14.html">最终幻想 XIV</a>
  </nav>

  <noscript>
    <style>
      #star-map-fallback { display: grid !important; }
      #star-map-loading,
      #star-map-signals,
      #star-map-readout,
      .star-map-provenance,
      .star-map-instruction { display: none !important; }
    </style>
  </noscript>
</section>
{% endblock %}
